                                "sense_id": "3ba9e72f-4136-3806-956c-fee2d4c8ebc7",
                                "text": "MrBeast was instead presented with a valuable lesson on the true cost of a dollar, posting later that day, “It is funny that when I say I’m buying TT I get unfathomable amount of messages from the ultra wealthy but when I fund raise it’s crickets.”"
